What?  I just started a knight, who starts with 4 pieces of armor, 2
weapons and 2 stacks of food.  Took off all armor (c, d, e, and f). 
(W)ear.  What do you want to wear? [cdef or ?*].  Hitting * or ? will
show you a list of armor that you can currently put on.  (W)ear only
works for armor, and the list will automatically exclude any items
that you cannot currently put on.

For instance, if you are wearing a cloak, but no body armor, body
armor will not be listed, as you first have to take off the cloak. 
Likewise, other cloaks would not be listed, since you may only wear
one cloak at a time.  The letters shown will always correspond to your
items of armor.

As an aside, you (P)ut on rings, amulets and facial gear (blindfold,
towel, lenses).

